1. Best Time To Buy and Sell Stocks:

Code:
class Solution {
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
  
        int left = 0;
        int right = 1;

        int maxProfit = 0;

        while (right < prices.length) {

            if (prices[right] > prices[left]) {
                int profit = prices[right] - prices[left];
                maxProfit = Math.max(maxProfit, profit);
            } else {
                left = right;
            }

            right++;
        }

        return maxProfit;
    }
}

Approach:
Use a sliding-window approach where left represents the best (lowest) buying price and right scans each day as the selling price. If a lower price is found, update left; otherwise, calculate and track the maximum profit.

Complexity:
Time: O(n) — the array is traversed once.
Space: O(1) — only constant extra variables are used.

